{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 12,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Job answered and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "No doubt but ye are the people,\nAnd wisdom shall die with you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I have understanding as well as you;\nI am not inferior to you:\nYea, who knoweth not such things as these?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am as one that is a laughing-stock to his neighbor,\nI who called upon God, and he answered:\nThe just, the perfect man is a laughing-stock.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the thought of him that is at ease there is contempt for misfortune;\nIt is ready for them whose foot slippeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The tents of robbers prosper,\nAnd they that provoke God are secure;Into whose hand God bringeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "abundantly",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ask now the beasts, and they shall teach thee;\nAnd the birds of the heavens, and they shall tell thee:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or speak to the earth, and it shall teach thee;\nAnd the fishes of the sea shall declare unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who knoweth not in all these,\nThat the hand of Jehovah hath wrought this,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In whose hand is the soul of every living thing,\nAnd the breath of all mankind?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Doth not the ear try words,\nEven as the palate tasteth its food?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With aged men is wisdom,\nAnd in length of days understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " is wisdom and might;\nHe hath counsel and understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he breaketh down, and it cannot be built again;\nHe shutteth up a man, and there can be no opening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he withholdeth the waters, and they dry up;\nAgain, he sendeth them out, and they overturn the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With him is strength and wisdom;\nThe deceived and the deceiver are his.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He leadeth counsellors away stripped,\nAnd judges maketh he fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He looseth the bond of kings,\nAnd he bindeth their loins with a girdle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He leadeth priests away stripped,\nAnd overthroweth the mighty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He removeth the speech of the trusty,\nAnd taketh away the understanding of the elders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He poureth contempt upon princes,\nAnd looseth the belt of the strong.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He uncovereth deep things out of darkness,\nAnd bringeth out to light the shadow of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He increaseth the nations, and he destroyeth them:\nHe enlargeth the nations, and he leadeth them captive.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He taketh away understanding from the chiefs of the people of the earth,\nAnd causeth them to wander in a wilderness where there is no way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.12.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.12.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They grope in the dark without light;\nAnd he maketh them to stagger like a drunken man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
